<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta
    
                     
  
  <title>North is Invisible — Community</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #080b10;
      --surface: #101720;
      --text: #f4f7f8;
      --muted: #a4afb8;
      --accent: #68f0b3;
      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 15%, rgba(40, 130, 95, 0.18), transparent 35%),
        var(--bg);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(8, 11, 16, 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }

    nav {
      min-height: 72px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .logo-mark {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #07110c;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .nav-link {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .nav-link:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 650px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 90px 0;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 92px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    }

    h1 span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .tagline {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 24px);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 700px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .hero-copy p + p {
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .hero-copy strong {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .button {
      min-height: 50px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 0 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #07110c;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: #a1ffd1;
    }

    .belief {
      padding: 75px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    }

    .belief blockquote {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: clamp(25px, 5vw, 42px);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    }

    .belief blockquote span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .contact {
      padding: 85px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 52px);
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .contact p {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 22px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .floating-contact {
      position: fixed;
      right: 22px;
      bottom: 22px;
      z-index: 20;
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #07110c;
      font-size: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .floating-contact:hover {
      transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .container {
        width: min(100% - 30px, 1100px);
      }

      nav {
        min-height: 64px;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: auto;
        padding: 85px 0;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .belief,
      .contact {
        padding: 65px 0;
      }

      .floating-contact {
        right: 16px;
        bottom: 16px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <nav class="container" aria-label="Navigasi utama">
      <a class="logo" href="#beranda">
        <span class="logo-mark">N</span>
        <span>North is Invisible</span>
      </a>
      <a class="nav-link" href="#kontak">Hubungi kami</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="beranda">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <div class="eyebrow">Leadership · Growth · Community</div>

          <h1>
            North is<br>
            <span>Invisible.</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="tagline">Kami bukan sekadar Team, kami adalah Community.</p>

          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p>
              Sebuah wadah yang kami bangun untuk para <strong>Leader</strong>,
              para <strong>Ketua Team</strong> yang ingin naik level.
            </p>

            <p>
              Jika di tempat lama kamu harus mengajari team dari nol sendirian,
              di sini kita akan melakukannya bersama.
            </p>

            <p>
              Sistem, ilmu, dan support sudah kami siapkan. Kamu tinggal bawa
              teammu dan bertumbuh bersama kami.
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            class="button"
            href="https://t.me/Northinvsble"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Mari berkolaborasi
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="belief">
      <div class="container">
        <blockquote>
          Karena kami percaya, kekuatan terbesar bukan di satu orang hebat,
          tapi di <span>komunitas yang hebat.</span>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="kontak">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">Mari bertumbuh bersama</div>
        <h2>Mari berkolaborasi.</h2>
        <p>Hubungi kami melalui Telegram: @Northinvsble</p>

        <a
          class="button"
          href="https://t.me/Northinvsble"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Contact @Northinvsble
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      © <span id="year"></span> North is Invisible. Kami bertumbuh bersama.
    </div>
  </footer>

  <a
    class="floating-contact"
    href="https://t.me/Northinvsble"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    aria-label="Hubungi North is Invisible di Telegram"
    title="Hubungi kami di Telegram"
  >
    ↗
  </a>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
